This directory contains the game contracts, type definitions, and fixture data.

Files (created by Smarak when the Next.js skeleton exists):
  game/
    contracts.ts        — GameSnapshot, MutationResult, Quest, BranchState, etc.
    fixtures/
      snapshot.ts       — Demo fixture GameSnapshot for frontend development

See docs/CONTRACTS.md for the full type definitions.
